          "PromptText": "The young woman wrinkles her forehead.\nThey can't be serious...\nYou take a quick look around. Yep, she's talking to you.\nI ask for an assistant... \nand they send me...\nVeronica looks at you with disbelief.\n...something looking like a science experiment sent here from Rubi-Ka!",
