          "PromptText": "Yes, this is a powerful artifact indeed.\n\nIt claims the soul of feeble creatures, if one knows how to release its dormant powers.\n\nFind out how utilize this Ancient Artifact and claim three souls in the name of Thrak.\nThe Hypnagogic unconsciously waves you away, whispering to himself.\nI must hurry! All the signs are in place. It is time.\n\nTime for us to act! Yes, I must let them know now.\nHe suddenly notices you still standing here.\nWhat are you waiting for, chosen one? Leave at once!\n Take this insignia of Thrak, it will aid us in our journey to glory.",
